:: Footwork Lesson
<<if $mmagymintro is 1 and $phase is 0>><<pass 20>><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>

<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "Footwork Lesson">>
<<else>>
    <<tiredness 4>><<wearandtear>><<npc Riley>><<person1>>
    <<cleareventpool>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(0)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Sandbag Stability Walks">><<run $usedEvents.push(0)>>
            The weight of the sandbag settles on your shoulders like a dead weight, pressing down with every step. Riley stands beside you, arms crossed.<br><br>

            "Walk across the gym and back. Keep your steps clean. If I shove you and you fall, we go again. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You take a deep breath and start walking.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                The weight is nothing. Your feet stay planted, body stable even when Riley shoves hard against your shoulder.<br><br>
                Riley watches but does not comment. "Good. That is balance." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                You handle the sandbag well, but each push throws off your steps slightly. You recover, but your footing is not perfect.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You feel that? Fix it." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                The first few steps are steady, but the shoves send you stumbling. You catch yourself, but barely.<br><br>
                Riley exhales. "If that was a real hit, you would be on the ground." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                The sandbag feels like a boulder. The first shove sends you completely off balance, forcing you to step sideways just to stay upright.<br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That ain't footwork. That is surviving." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(1)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Resistance Band Dodges">><<run $usedEvents.push(1)>>
            The resistance band tightens around your waist as Riley holds the other end, stance firm.<br><br>

            "Dodge left, right, step forward, back. If the band drags you too far, you lose. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You brace yourself and start moving.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                The tension is there, but you absorb the resistance effortlessly, dodging cleanly without losing control.<br><br>
                Riley watches. "That is control. Keep it that way." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                Your dodges are solid, but the band pulls harder than expected, and you struggle to adjust on the fly.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You are still letting the pull control you. Fix it." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                Every dodge feels like a fight against the band. Your footing is unstable, and you barely recover in time.<br><br>
                Riley sighs. "That ain't balance. That is surviving." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                The band yanks you off-center every single time. You stumble, unable to keep your stance solid.<br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That will get you dropped in a real fight." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(2)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Drop-Step Recovery Training">><<run $usedEvents.push(2)>>
            Riley stands in front of you, arms crossed. "You get knocked back, you recover. No stumbling, no hesitation. If I shove you, step back into position instantly. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You brace yourself, feet planted.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                Every shove barely moves you. Your foot shifts instinctively, body recovering before you lose balance.<br><br>
                Riley watches. "That is how you stop yourself from hitting the floor." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                The first few pushes are fine, but the harder ones knock you back slightly. You recover quickly, but it takes effort.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "Too slow. Faster resets." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                Every push sends you staggering back. You recover, but not before losing stance.<br><br>
                Riley exhales. "That is a knockdown waiting to happen." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                Riley barely shoves you, and you nearly fall over. You try to regain balance, but your footing is all over the place.<br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "You cannot recover at all. Fix that." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(3)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Sandbag Repositioning Drills">><<run $usedEvents.push(3)>>
            You hold a heavy sandbag against your chest as Riley watches. "Move it—left, right, up, down. Keep your balance. If you stumble, reset. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You shift the weight as instructed.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                Your body stays solid, adapting instantly as the weight shifts.<br><br>
                Riley gives a small nod. "Good control." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                Some shifts throw off your stance for a second, but you catch yourself before stumbling.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "Close, but not perfect." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                Each sudden weight shift forces you to step awkwardly. You barely keep steady.<br><br>
                Riley exhales. "You would be on the floor if that was a real push." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                The first weight shift sends you stumbling sideways. You cannot control the balance changes at all.<br><br>
                Riley sighs. "You are dead weight. Get stronger footing." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(4)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Belt Tension Footwork">><<run $usedEvents.push(4)>>
            A belt is wrapped around your waist, held by Riley. "Move. Forward, back, pivot. If you lose your stance, I pull harder. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You take your first step.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                The resistance is barely noticeable. Your movements are controlled, footwork smooth even with the pull.<br><br>
                Riley watches. "That is how you keep control under pressure." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                You keep your form, but every few steps, the pull throws off your rhythm slightly.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You are still letting it affect you. Fix it." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                The belt drags at you every time you move. You are fighting it, not moving naturally.<br><br>
                Riley exhales. "If you need to fight this much, you are not in control." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                You can barely move properly. The moment Riley pulls, you stagger forward or back completely out of control.<br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That ain't footwork. That is struggling." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$usedEvents.includes(5)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Stability Jump Landings">><<run $usedEvents.push(5)>>
            Riley stands with arms crossed. "Jump forward, left, right, backward. Land in stance. No stumbles. 20 minutes."<br><br>

            You take your first jump.  
            <<if $combatExtended.footwork gte 600>><<footwork 8>><<physique 1>>
                You land clean every time, adjusting without a second thought.<br><br>
                Riley gives a rare nod. "That is how you keep balance in motion." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 400>><<footwork 9>><<physique 1>>
                You hold your stance well, but the landings are not perfect. Some shifts take an extra second to correct.<br><br>
                Riley grunts. "Better, but you are still taking too long." <<gfootwork>>
            <<elseif $combatExtended.footwork gte 200>><<footwork 10>><<physique 1>>
                Every landing is shaky. Your stance breaks slightly before you regain balance.<br><br>
                Riley exhales. "A real opponent would already have punished that mistake." <<gfootwork>>
            <<else>><<footwork 12>><<physique 1>>
                You lose control every time. You stumble, nearly falling more than once.<br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "You might as well be falling on your own." <<gfootwork>>
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<runeventpool>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $gymstage gte 2>>
        Riley checks the time. "That is 20 minutes. Session's over. Go, I have others to train."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        Riley checks the time. "That is 20 minutes. Next station. Do not waste my time."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Footwork Lesson]]>><<set $gymstage += 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>